00:53:28.920 --> 00:53:33.080
Then he winked at us and said, "I've got you covered. I've got you boys covered."

00:53:33.680 --> 00:53:37.040
I always think of him when I think about Bodhichitta.  So

00:53:37.680 --> 00:53:42.000
you will directly encounter every living being in the universe.

00:53:42.600 --> 00:53:46.600
And you will say: "Big John has you covered. I'll take care of you. Don't worry."

00:53:47.200 --> 00:53:49.280
Do not worry.  I'll take care of you.

