You will say to them: "I'll take care of you. Don't worry. I'll take care of you."

00:54:15.400 --> 00:54:20.040
Big Mike will take care of you, or Big Tim, or Big Seiji.

00:54:20.600 --> 00:54:22.600
Do not worry.  Do

00:54:23.080 --> 00:54:25.480
n't stress.  It's my turn!  That's exactly how it

